{
  "about": "A relay's id on a server and its list token. relay id = the version 4 UUID made of the first 16 bytes of sha256(\"<seed>:relay:<name>:<nonce>\"): byte 6 = (byte 6 & 0x0f) | 0x40, byte 8 = (byte 8 & 0x3f) | 0x80, written lowercase 8-4-4-4-12. list token = the first 32 hex characters of sha256(\"<relay id>:list\"). seed: 64 lowercase hex characters, hashed as text; name: 1 to 24 of A-Z a-z 0-9 . _ -; nonce: 16 lowercase hex characters. Every implementation (xray-entrypoint relay-id, dotdash's server and manager) is tested against these.",
